homelab-postfix-block-link (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix postinst: homelab-postfix-block-link-bootstrap-role is installed
    to /usr/bin by Makefile.PL's EXE_FILES (standard perl_makemaker
    layout), not under $SHARE_DIR/script -- postinst was invoking the
    wrong path and failed on first live install (exit 127, package left
    half-configured). Found deploying to ct05.

