homelab-postfix-block-link (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Postfix milter add-on injecting a click-to-block
    link into inbound mail. Wires into smtpd_milters/non_smtpd_milters
    alongside OpenDKIM via the same idempotent postconf -e pattern
    homelab-postfix's own postinst already uses. Requires
    homelab-postfix and a pre-existing homelab-block-link schema (see
    that package's own README.md "Install order" section).

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0500
